OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy start, with outbreaks
OL,6,Fof rain sinking southeastwards.
OL,7,FTurning drier and brighter from the
OL,8,Fwest by mid-morning with plenty of dry
OL,9,Fand sunny spells. Isolated showers may
OL,10,Fform later but feeling much fresher
OL,11,Fthan of late.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FShowers continuing in places
OL,14,Fwithin the northwesterly breeze, gusty
OL,15,Faround coastal areas. Turning cloudier
OL,16,Fovernight, feeling cooler than
OL,17,Fprevious nights.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
