OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FWinds ease through the day
OL,6,Fas they shift from a northwesterly to
OL,7,Fa wester. Showers continuing across
OL,8,Fthe region, however, these will be
OL,9,Flighter. Temperatures around average
OL,10,Ffor September.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FA
OL,13,Fwet and windy day for Thursday but
OL,14,Fthings starting to turn more settled
OL,15,Fagain by Friday. Westerly winds
OL,16,Fdevelop with the odd light shower.
OL,17,FTemperature near normal.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
